          "story": "Six months after greenlighting the new plant, Gelat-oat hit shelves with strong early buzz and solid velocity in its best accounts. Heather’s team watched active accounts and pints per account weekly, but with adoption lagging at 48% versus plan, the shortfall took too long to register. Meanwhile, a texture drift slipped through for weeks before QA tightened “golden sample” checks. Carlos stayed energized—momentum is real, but discipline is now the priority.",
